{"id":"vod_md_3501","vodId":"3501","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"终物语","name_cn":"终物语","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230827-1/a14bcec1c33bbba1f7b01a3ec0550b6a.jpg"},"summary":"《终物语》讲述改编自日本轻小说家西尾维新著作、台湾插画家VOFAN负责插画的轻小说，是《物语系列》终季（Final Season）的第3部，分为上中下三册。《终物语》是物语系列小说第三部分的第二弹作品。其内容包括第完话：扇黑暗（おうぎダーク），讲述了与一种被阿良良木历称为暗/黑暗之影（くらやみ）的怪异有关的故事。 实际上暗根本没有名字。不是怪异，甚至是根本不存在的非存在。卧烟伊豆湖称之为怪异的反存在，世界、命运的修正力本身，追杀偏离了怪异之道的怪异的非存在。看上去是一团漆黑黑洞般，让人联想到黑洞。可将接触到东西的存在完全消失，甚至可以切断历与忍野忍的链。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-27 09:32:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/RlFOsC9B/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/2tMcoK7g/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/ieMlkZ2Z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/ziSWWCX3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/c22ZIw04/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/0hRDrVlx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/g5rbASAK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/MFP76BWQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/gD7uJMCh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/IF8Uetrm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/rQ3H8zPX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/MlozBuka/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:28.256Z"}